  <text id="global-heading" x="825" y="363" width="280" height="27" font="body" size="22" color="ink">Global responsibility</text>
  <text id="global-copy" x="750" y="425" width="370" height="106" font="body" size="17" color="muted" line-height="1.42"><p>Accurate item descriptions and lawful behavior.</p><p>Compliance with customs, airline, carrier, and destination requirements.</p><p>No claim of customs approval or legal clearance.</p></text>
